        (317, 'SME 0043 - Evolução de tela - Critérios de Mobilização - Modal Historico de criterios', '<b style="font-weight:normal;"><p dir=ltr style="text-align:center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:''Arial Narrow'',sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:700;">SOLICITAÇÃO DE MANUTENÇÃO EVOLUTIVA – SME</span><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:''Arial Narrow'',sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:700;"><br></span> </p><p dir=ltr style="text-align:center;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:''Arial Narrow'',sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:700;"><br></span><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:''Arial Narrow'',sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;">EVOLUÇÃO DE TELA - CRITERIOS DE MOBILIZAÇÃO - MODAL HISTÓRICO DE CRITERIO</span> </p><br><br><br><div dir=ltr style="margin-left:14.4pt;" align=left><table style="border:none;border-collapse:collapse;"><colgroup><col width=188><col width=396></colgroup><tbody><tr><td style="border-left:solid #000000 1pt;border-right:solid #000000 0.5pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 0.75pt;border-top:solid #000000 1pt;vertical-align:middle;padding:0pt 5.75pt 0pt 5.75pt;overflow:hidden;"><p dir=ltr style="text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:''Arial Narrow'',sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:400;">SME Nº.:&nbsp;</span> </p> </td><td style="border-left:solid #000000 0.5pt;border-right:solid #000000 1pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 0.75pt;border-top:solid #000000 1pt;vertical-align:top;padding:0pt 5.75pt 0pt 5.75pt;overflow:hidden;"><p dir=ltr style="text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:''Arial Narrow'',sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:400;">43</span> </p> </td></tr><tr><td style="border-left:solid #000000 1pt;border-right:solid #000000 0.5pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 0.75pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.75pt;vertical-align:middle;padding:0pt 5.75pt 0pt 5.75pt;overflow:hidden;"><p dir=ltr style="text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:''Arial Narrow'',sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:400;">Cliente:&nbsp;</span> </p> </td><td style="border-left:solid #000000 0.5pt;border-right:solid #000000 1pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 0.75pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.75pt;vertical-align:top;padding:0pt 5.75pt 0pt 5.75pt;overflow:hidden;"><p dir=ltr style="text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:''Arial Narrow'',sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:400;">SESI – USSI</span> </p> </td></tr><tr><td style="border-left:solid #000000 1pt;border-right:solid #000000 0.5pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 0.75pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.75pt;vertical-align:middle;padding:0pt 5.75pt 0pt 5.75pt;overflow:hidden;"><p dir=ltr style="text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:''Arial Narrow'',sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:400;">Projeto:&nbsp;</span> </p> </td><td style="border-left:solid #000000 0.5pt;border-right:solid #000000 1pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 0.75pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.75pt;vertical-align:top;padding:0pt 5.75pt 0pt 5.75pt;overflow:hidden;"><p dir=ltr style="text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:''Arial Narrow'',sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:400;">Evolução SEIF&nbsp;</span> </p> </td></tr><tr><td style="border-left:solid #000000 1pt;border-right:solid #000000 0.5pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 0.75pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.75pt;vertical-align:middle;padding:0pt 5.75pt 0pt 5.75pt;overflow:hidden;"><p dir=ltr style="text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:''Arial Narrow'',sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:400;">Produto:</span> </p> </td><td style="border-left:solid #000000 0.5pt;border-right:solid #000000 1pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 0.75pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.75pt;vertical-align:top;padding:0pt 5.75pt 0pt 5.75pt;overflow:hidden;"><p dir=ltr style="text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:''Arial Narrow'',sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:400;">SEIF</span> </p> </td></tr><tr><td style="border-left:solid #000000 1pt;border-right:solid #000000 0.5pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 0.75pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.75pt;vertical-align:middle;padding:0pt 5.75pt 0pt 5.75pt;overflow:hidden;"><p dir=ltr style="text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:''Arial Narrow'',sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:400;">Data:</span> </p> </td><td style="border-left:solid #000000 0.5pt;border-right:solid #000000 1pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 0.75pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.75pt;vertical-align:top;padding:0pt 5.75pt 0pt 5.75pt;overflow:hidden;"><p dir=ltr style="text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:''Arial Narrow'',sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:400;">01/12/2024</span> </p> </td></tr><tr><td style="border-left:solid #000000 1pt;border-right:solid #000000 0.5pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 1pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.75pt;vertical-align:middle;padding:0pt 5.75pt 0pt 5.75pt;overflow:hidden;"><p dir=ltr style="text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:''Arial Narrow'',sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:400;">Solicitado Por:&nbsp;</span> </p> </td><td style="border-left:solid #000000 0.5pt;border-right:solid #000000 1pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 1pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.75pt;vertical-align:top;padding:0pt 5.75pt 0pt 5.75pt;overflow:hidden;"><br> </td></tr><tr><td colspan=2 style="border-left:solid #000000 1pt;border-right:solid #000000 1pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 1pt;border-top:solid #000000 1pt;vertical-align:middle;padding:0pt 5.75pt 0pt 5.75pt;overflow:hidden;"><p dir=ltr style="text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:''Arial Narrow'',sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:700;">Observação: </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:''Arial Narrow'',sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:400;">N/A</span> </p> </td></tr></tbody></table> </div><br><p dir=ltr style="text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:''Arial Narrow'',sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:700;">I. DESCRIÇÃO&nbsp;</span> </p><p dir=ltr style="text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:''Arial Narrow'',sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:400;">O escopo desta Solicitação de Manutenção Evolutiva - SME refere-se à necessidade de Desenvolvimento e Sustentação (Manutenção Evolutiva e Manutenção Corretiva) de Sistemas com tecnologia Backend: Java Spring</span> </p><p dir=ltr style="text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:''Arial Narrow'',sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:400;">Frontend: React.js, Aplicativo: React Native, Banco de Dados: Postgres nas suas versões mais recentes, conforme detalhamento a seguir:</span> </p><br><br><p dir=ltr style="text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:''Arial Narrow'',sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:700;">ALTERAÇÃO ou CRIAÇÃO NA TELA, COLUNA, CAMPO, FRAME, – SME, realizada no front-end, back-end e no banco de dados.</span><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:400;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:''Arial Narrow'',sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:400;">&nbsp;</span> </p><br><p dir=ltr style="text-align:justify;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:''Arial Narrow'',sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:700;">História de usuário: Tela de Critérios</span> </p><p dir=ltr style="text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:''Arial Narrow'',sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:400;">Como um usuário do tipo SESI (DN, DR e UO),</span> </p><p dir=ltr style="text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:''Arial Narrow'',sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:400;">Eu quero cadastrar novos critérios para Empresas Clientes no sistema,</span> </p><p dir=ltr style="text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:''Arial Narrow'',sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:400;">Para que eu possa gerenciar critérios da Empresa Cliente, exigindo obrigatoriedade de documentos para mobilização e demais módulos do sistema.</span> </p><p dir=ltr style="text-align:justify;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;"><br> </p></b><div><b>LINK:&nbsp;<a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/10q4PSHgfmY3URl0WDcGgEy05svB-bbCz/edit#heading=h.l1derl283fg4">https://docs.google.com/document/d/10q4PSHgfmY3URl0WDcGgEy05svB-bbCz/edit#heading=h.l1derl283fg4</a></b> </div>', null, null, 'completed', 'high', 'feature', 'azure_devops', '11970', 'Tribo SEIF\Projetos\Gestão de Terceiros', 'Tribo SEIF\Sprints SEIF Gestão de Terceiros\Sprint 002.2025', null, null, 'User Story', null, null, 21, 3, '2026-03-05 22:46:16.680', '2026-03-05 22:46:26', 314, null),
