:</span> </p> </td><td style="border-left:solid #000000 0.5pt;border-right:solid #000000 1pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 0.75pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.75pt;vertical-align:top;padding:0pt 5.75pt 0pt 5.75pt;overflow:hidden;"><p dir=ltr style="text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:''Arial Narrow'',sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:400;">SEIF</span> </p> </td></tr><tr><td style="border-left:solid #000000 1pt;border-right:solid #000000 0.5pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 0.75pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.75pt;vertical-align:middle;padding:0pt 5.75pt 0pt 5.75pt;overflow:hidden;"><p dir=ltr style="text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:''Arial Narrow'',sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:400;">Data:</span> </p> </td><td style="border-left:solid #000000 0.5pt;border-right:solid #000000 1pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 0.75pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.75pt;vertical-align:top;padding:0pt 5.75pt 0pt 5.75pt;overflow:hidden;"><p dir=ltr style="text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:''Arial Narrow'',sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:400;">01/12/2024</span> </p> </td></tr><tr><td style="border-left:solid #000000 1pt;border-right:solid #000000 0.5pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 1pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.75pt;vertical-align:middle;padding:0pt 5.75pt 0pt 5.75pt;overflow:hidden;"><p dir=ltr style="text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:''Arial Narrow'',sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:400;">Solicitado Por:&nbsp;</span> </p> </td><td style="border-left:solid #000000 0.5pt;border-right:solid #000000 1pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 1pt;border-top:solid #000000 0.75pt;vertical-align:top;padding:0pt 5.75pt 0pt 5.75pt;overflow:hidden;"><br> </td></tr><tr><td colspan=2 style="border-left:solid #000000 1pt;border-right:solid #000000 1pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 1pt;border-top:solid #000000 1pt;vertical-align:middle;padding:0pt 5.75pt 0pt 5.75pt;overflow:hidden;"><p dir=ltr style="text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:''Arial Narrow'',sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:700;">Observação: </span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:''Arial Narrow'',sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:400;">N/A</span> </p> </td></tr></tbody></table> </div><br><p dir=ltr style="text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:''Arial Narrow'',sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:700;">I. DESCRIÇÃO&nbsp;</span> </p><p dir=ltr style="text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:''Arial Narrow'',sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:400;">O escopo desta Solicitação de Manutenção Evolutiva - SME refere-se à necessidade de Desenvolvimento e Sustentação (Manutenção Evolutiva e Manutenção Corretiva) de Sistemas com tecnologia Backend: Java Spring</span> </p><p dir=ltr style="text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:''Arial Narrow'',sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:400;">Frontend: React.js, Aplicativo: React Native, Banco de Dados: Postgres nas suas versões mais recentes, conforme detalhamento a seguir:</span> </p><br><br><p dir=ltr style="text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:''Arial Narrow'',sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:700;">ALTERAÇÃO ou CRIAÇÃO NA TELA, COLUNA, CAMPO, FRAME, – SME, realizada no front-end, back-end e no banco de dados.</span><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:400;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:''Arial Narrow'',sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:400;">&nbsp;</span> </p><br><p dir=ltr style="text-align:justify;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:''Arial Narrow'',sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:700;">História de usuário: Tela de Critérios</span> </p><p dir=ltr style="text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:''Arial Narrow'',sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:400;">Como um usuário do tipo SESI (DN, DR e UO),</span> </p><p dir=ltr style="text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:''Arial Narrow'',sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:400;">Eu quero cadastrar novos critérios para Empresas Clientes no sistema,</span> </p><p dir=ltr style="text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:''Arial Narrow'',sans-serif;color:#000000;font-weight:400;">Para que eu possa gerenciar critérios da Empresa Cliente, exigindo obrigatoriedade de documentos para mobilização e demais módulos do sistema.</span> </p><div dir=ltr style="text-align:justify;margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:16px;">SME Sharepoint CNI:<br><a href="https://cnicombr.sharepoint.com/:w:/r/sites/sussiexterno/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=%7bDA1C64D4-4089-4412-A203-D18F411FB7CB%7d&amp;file=SME%200043%20-%20Evolu%C3%A7%C3%A3o%20de%20tela%20-%20Crit%C3%A9rios%20de%20Mobiliza%C3%A7%C3%A3o%20-%20Modal%20Historico%20de%20criterios.docx&amp;action=default&amp;mobileredirect=true">https://cnicombr.sharepoint.com/:w:/r/sites/sussiexterno/_layouts/15/Doc.aspx?sourcedoc=%7BDA1C64D4-4089-4412-A203-D18F411FB7CB%7D&amp;file=SME%200043%20-%20Evolu%C3%A7%C3%A3o%20de%20tela%20-%20Crit%C3%A9rios%20de%20Mobiliza%C3%A7%C3%A3o%20-%20Modal%20Historico%20de%20criterios.docx&amp;action=default&amp;mobileredirect=true</a><br> </div></b>', null, null, 'completed', 'high', 'task', 'azure_devops', '13959', 'Tribo SEIF\Projetos\Gestão de Terceiros', 'Tribo SEIF\Sprints SEIF Gestão de Terceiros\Sprint 002.2025', 'BACKEND; FRONT-END', null, 'Task', 'LUCAS VIANA RODRIGUES', 'lucas.rodrigues@sc.senai.br', 21, 3, '2026-03-05 22:46:18.594', '2026-03-05 22:46:27', 317, null),
