        (706, '[3] Perfil com aprovação automática de documentos ao alterar dentro da emp', '<div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>*****************************************************************************************************************************************</font> </div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Prezados,</font> </div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Vinculado a solicitação interna via Slack</font><b style="font-weight:bolder;">&nbsp;ABERTO DIA 16/09/2025</b> </div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><br> </div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>1) Oque ocorre?<br><br><div style="margin:0px;display:block;">Solicitante: Renan Zapelini do Nascimento – Analista de Qualidade </div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;">Sistema: SEIF&nbsp;Chamada Tecnológica (https://seif.sesi.org.br/): </div></font><font><div style="margin:0px;display:block;">Ambiente: Produção<br><br>Necessário que alguns<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style="font-weight:bolder;">perfis de usuário</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>possuam a funcionalidade de<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style="font-weight:bolder;">aprovar automaticamente</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>documentos no estabelecimento ao serem alterados dentro da empresa.<br><strong style="font-weight:bolder;">Ações sugeridas:</strong><br><ul style="margin:1.12em 0px 1.12em 40px;list-style:disc;display:block;"><li style="margin:0px;display:list-item;">Analisar com o analista responsável<br> </li><li style="margin:0px;display:list-item;">Verificar estimativa de implementação<br> </li> </ul><strong style="font-weight:bolder;">Área responsável:</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>Front-end e Back-end<br><strong style="font-weight:bolder;">Impacto:</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>Facilitar e agilizar o fluxo de aprovação de documentos dentro do sistema<br><br>***************************************************************************************************************************************** </div></font> </div>Migrado da tarefa:&nbsp;<a href="https://servicos.fiescnet.com.br/indexAtendente.html#/main/paginaUrl/MostraTarefa.asp/TarID=1114006">1114006</a> </div>', null, null, 'pending', 'low', 'improvement', 'azure_devops', '26336', 'Tribo SEIF\Sustentação\Chamada Tecnológica', 'Tribo SEIF', null, null, 'Improvement', null, null, 32, 2, '2026-03-05 22:46:19.226', '2026-03-05 22:46:19.226', null, null),
        (707, 'Dev - Apontamento de Horas', null, null, null, 'pending', 'high', 'task', 'azure_devops', '26337', 'Tribo SEIF\Sustentação\Chamada Tecnológica', 'Tribo SEIF', null, null, 'Task', null, null, 32, 2, '2026-03-05 22:46:19.227', '2026-03-05 22:46:27', 706, null),
        (708, '[7] Relatórios em XML da catraca gerados com quebras de linha incorretas', '<div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>*****************************************************************************************************************************************</font> </div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Prezados,</font> </div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Vinculado a solicitação interna via Slack</font><b style="font-weight:bolder;">&nbsp;ABERTO DIA 17/09/2025</b> </div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><br> </div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>1) Oque ocorre?<br><br><div style="margin:0px;display:block;">Solicitante:&nbsp; </div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;"><br> </div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;">Solicitante: João Damiani - Tech Lead </div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;">Sistema: SEIF&nbsp;Chamada Tecnológica (https://seif.sesi.org.br/): </div></font><font><div style="margin:0px;display:block;">Ambiente: Produção<br><br>A geração dos relatórios em XML da catraca está desconfigurada, apresentando quebras de linha em locais incorretos, o que impossibilita a utilização adequada do arquivo.<br>Link de referência com print do problema:<span>&nbsp;</span><a target=_blank href="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1D2MNUc36Xu-917fL-antya77aseCWRll/edit?usp=sharing&amp;ouid=104065652510516762471&amp;rtpof=true&amp;sd=true" style="text-decoration:underline;">Arquivo Google Sheets</a><br><br><img src="https://servicos.fiescnet.com.br/WriteImage.ashx?CRC32=9324a987"><br><br>Tarefa migrada do 0800:&nbsp;<a href="https://servicos.fiescnet.com.br/indexAtendente.html#/main/paginaUrl/MostraTarefa.asp/TarID=1114087">1114087</a><br>***************************************************************************************************************************************** </div></font> </div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Favor verificar.</font> </div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Att,</font> </div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Wesley Macedo Pinto</font> </div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>SENAI/SC - Soluções Digitais&nbsp;</font><span style="color:rgb(33, 33, 33);font-size:11pt;">&nbsp;</span><a target=_blank href="https://www.instagram.com/senaisolucoesdigitais.sc/" style="color:rgb(17, 85, 204);font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;;text-decoration:underline;font-size:17.3333px;"><img src="https://ci3.googleusercontent.com/mail-sig/AIorK4wYQaC11fKLpqU5BR6NaVhZa9VkI0AxOacrnkINuwwY9jpdggMHbIQfOy8kAH2nu0qs0lNZ_8k" style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:small;color:rgb(32, 33, 36);"></a><span style="color:rgb(33, 33, 33);font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;;font-size:17.3333px;">&nbsp;</span><a target=_blank href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/senai-solu%C3%A7%C3%B5es-digitais/" style="color:rgb(17, 85, 204);font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;;text-decoration:underline;font-size: