        (726, '[38][Melhoria][Backlog] API para extração mensal de respostas de checklist', '<div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>*****************************************************************************************************************************************</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Prezados,<br><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><b>Solicitação realizada pelo colaborador</b>:&nbsp;<span>JONATHAN NEVES</span><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><br> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>1) Oque ocorre?<br><br><p><strong>Descrição:</strong><br>
Criar uma API para realizar a <strong>extração mensal das respostas dos checklists</strong>, seguindo o mesmo padrão utilizado no SEIF 2.0. </p><p>A exportação deve conter as seguintes informações: </p><ul><li><p>Razão Social </p> </li><li><p>Nome do Estabelecimento </p> </li><li><p>CEP </p> </li><li><p>Endereço Completo </p> </li><li><p>Número da Rua </p> </li><li><p>Título do Checklist </p> </li><li><p>Data da Resposta </p> </li><li><p>Número de Trabalhadores na Obra </p> </li> </ul><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><br> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>*****************************************************************************************************************************************</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Favor verificar.</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Att,</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Wesley Macedo Pinto</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>SENAI/SC - Soluções Digitais&nbsp;</font><span style="color:rgb(33, 33, 33);font-size:11pt;">&nbsp;</span><a target=_blank href="https://www.instagram.com/senaisolucoesdigitais.sc/" style="color:rgb(17, 85, 204);font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;;font-size:17.3333px;"><img src="https://ci3.googleusercontent.com/mail-sig/AIorK4wYQaC11fKLpqU5BR6NaVhZa9VkI0AxOacrnkINuwwY9jpdggMHbIQfOy8kAH2nu0qs0lNZ_8k" style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:small;color: