        (758, '[26][Melhoria][Backlog] Disponibilizar foto do trabalhador no endpoint de', '<div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>*****************************************************************************************************************************************</font> </div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Prezados,</font> </div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Vinculado a solicitação interna realizada pelo&nbsp;</font>João Luccas Damiani - Tech Lead&nbsp; </div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><br> </div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>1) Oque ocorre?</font> </div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Demanda Migrada do 0800:&nbsp;<a href="https://servicos.fiescnet.com.br/indexAtendente.html#/main/paginaUrl/MostraTarefa.asp/TarID=1115212">1115212</a></font> </div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><a href="https://servicos.fiescnet.com.br/indexAtendente.html#/main/paginaUrl/MostraTarefa.asp/TarID=1115212"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </a> </div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;">Solicita-se que a<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style="font-weight:bolder;">foto do trabalhador</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>(<code style="font-weight:normal;font-family:monospace;">avatarFileName</code>) seja incluída no retorno do endpoint:<br><div style="margin:0px;display:block;"><div style="margin:0px;display:block;"><div style="margin:0px;display:block;"><div style="margin:0px;display:block;"> </div> </div> </div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;"><code style="font-weight:normal;font-family:monospace;">bi-<span>data</span><span>//worker/entrance-permissions/{establishmentId}</span></code> </div> </div><br><br>Essa alteração será utilizada na<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style="font-weight:bolder;">catraca da DIMAS</strong>, permitindo reduzir o consumo de<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style="font-weight:bolder;">dois endpoints para apenas um</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>no código Python da catraca.<br><strong style="font-weight:bolder;">Solução proposta:</strong><br><ul style="margin:1.12em 0px 1.12em 40px;list-style:disc;display:block;"><li style="margin:0px;display:list-item;">Ajustar o endpoint para incluir o campo<span>&nbsp;</span><code style="font-weight:normal;font-family:monospace;">avatarFileName</code><span>&nbsp;</span>no retorno.<br> </li><li style="margin:0px;display:list-item;">Validar que o endpoint continue retornando corretamente os demais dados de permissões de entrada.<br> </li> </ul><b style="font-weight:bolder;"><br><br></b>***************************************************************************************************************************************** </div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Favor verificar.</font> </div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Att,</font> </div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Wesley Macedo Pinto</font> </div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="