        (784, '[39][Melhoria] Inclusão de filtro e coluna por fornecedor na tela de trabalhadores vinculados', '<div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>*****************************************************************************************************************************************</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Prezados,<br></font> </div><br><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><br> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>1) Oque ocorre?</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br><p>Atualmente, na tela de <strong>trabalhadores vinculados</strong> ou na <strong>edição do trabalhador</strong>, não é possível identificar a qual fornecedor o trabalhador pertence.<br>
Solicita-se incluir: </p><ul><li><p><strong>Uma coluna</strong> com o nome do fornecedor (supervisor), semelhante à lista de trabalhadores; </p> </li><li><p><strong>Um filtro</strong> para exibir apenas os trabalhadores de um fornecedor específico. </p> </li> </ul></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><div><br> </div><div><br> </div><div>2) Anexos exibem o ocorrido.<br><img src="https://dev.azure.com/senaisc-solucoes-digitais/c8f81c43-58a6-4ce1-96ce-4771ae6a012d/_apis/wit/attachments/5b03bb70-6605-43fc-b78a-41e6690a0a6c?fileName=image.png" alt=Image><br> </div><div><br> </div> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>*****************************************************************************************************************************************</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Favor verificar.</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Att,</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Wesley Macedo Pinto</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>SENAI/SC - Soluções Digitais&nbsp;</font><span style="color:rgb(33, 33, 33);font-size:11pt;">&nbsp;</span><a target=_blank href="https://www.instagram.com/senaisolucoesdigitais.sc/" style="color:rgb(17, 85, 204);font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;;font-size:17.3333px;"><img src="https://ci3.googleusercontent.com/mail-sig/AIorK4wYQaC11fKLpqU5BR6NaVhZa9VkI0AxOacrnkINuwwY9jpdggMHbIQfOy8kAH2nu0qs0lNZ_8k" style="font-family:Aria