        (807, '[2]Problema no filtro de vinculação de trabalhadores', '<div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>*****************************************************************************************************************************************</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Prezados,</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Vinculado a solciitação interna realizada pelo&nbsp;Jonathan Neves</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>1) Oque ocorre?</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br>&nbsp;O filtro utilizado no momento de vincular trabalhadores não está funcionando corretamente. Ao tentar aplicar qualquer critério de busca, o sistema não retorna os resultados esperados, impossibilitando a seleção dos trabalhadores desejados para o vínculo.<br><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;">2) Anexos exibem o ocorrido. </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><div><img src="https://dev.azure.com/senaisc-solucoes-digitais/c8f81c43-58a6-4ce1-96ce-4771ae6a012d/_apis/wit/attachments/51fe0df2-553e-4640-9ee7-9016f1f8fe55?fileName=image.png" alt=Image><br> </div><div><br> </div> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>*****************************************************************************************************************************************</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Favor verificar.</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><fon