        (824, '[SS] Cadastramento via API de empresas, estabelecimentos e checklists – Solicitação de Lucas Bergmann', '<div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>*****************************************************************************************************************************************</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Prezados,</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Vinculado ao chamado <b>&nbsp;ABERTO DIA 11/11/2025</b></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><br> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>1) Oque ocorre?</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL></font> </div>Solicitante <strong>Lucas Bergmann</strong> encaminhou, via e-mail, <strong>solicitação de cadastramento via API</strong>, utilizando o <strong>software Postman</strong>, das <strong>empresas, estabelecimentos e checklists</strong> relacionados na <strong>planilha em anexo</strong>.<div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><br> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><div><br> </div><div>2) Anexos exibem o ocorrido. </div><div><img src="https://dev.azure.com/senaisc-solucoes-digitais/c8f81c43-58a6-4ce1-96ce-4771ae6a012d/_apis/wit/attachments/dc5460fd-e16c-4eb3-9505-fa2f5bc209b1?fileName=image.png" alt=Image><br> </div> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>*****************************************************************************************************************************************</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Favor verificar.</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Att,</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Wesley Macedo Pinto</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>SENAI/SC - Soluções Digitais&nbsp;</font><span style="color:rgb(33, 33, 33);font-size:11pt;">&nbsp;</span><a target=_blank href="https://www.instagram.com/senaisolucoesdigitais.sc/" style="color:rgb(17, 85, 204);font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;;font-size:17.3333px;"><img src="https://ci3.googleusercontent.com/mail-sig/AIorK4wYQaC11fKLpqU5BR6NaVhZa9VkI0AxOacrnkINuwwY9jpdggMHbIQfOy8kAH2nu0qs0lNZ_8k" style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:small;color:rgb(32, 33, 36);"></a><span style="color:rgb(33, 33, 33);font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;;font-size:17.3333px;">&nbsp;</span><a target=_blank href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/senai-solu%C3%A7%C3%B5es-digitais/" style="color:rgb(17, 85, 204);font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;;font-size:17.3333px;"><img src="https://ci3.googleusercontent.com/mail-sig/AIorK4yoZ1R9g3fRoH8Zx9DJsz1IMoVdCGzfGBizZOUiANB8tz93hmoDucjkavskhK8ZXcCSiJz1bnk" style="font-family:Arial;font-size:11pt;"></a><span style="color:rgb(33, 33, 33);font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;;font-size:17.3333px;">&nbsp;</span><a target=_blank href="https://www.facebook.com/senaisolucoesdigitais.sc/" style="color:rgb(17, 85, 204);font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;;font-size:17.3333px;"><img src="https://ci3.googleusercontent.com/mail-sig/AIorK4xaI0BU0P03TbA_QM4W3_pkYh6xHU6xGVrzTdm8nQWhVuaejPeLebs67y01AtkmVUMzQjeKTrQ"><