        (830, '[Incidente] Sistema não salva relatórios e não exibe mensagem de erro', '<div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>*****************************************************************************************************************************************</font> </div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Prezados,</font> </div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Vinculado a solicitação interna via Slack do&nbsp;</font>Paulo Zaneripe<b style="font-weight:bolder;">&nbsp;ABERTO DIA 30/10/2025<br><br>Demanda migrada do 0800:&nbsp;<a href="https://servicos.fiescnet.com.br/indexAtendente.html#/main/paginaUrl/MostraTarefa.asp/TarID=1117127">1117127</a></b> </div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><br> </div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>1) Oque ocorre?</font> </div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><br> </div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><br>Ao tentar salvar os relatórios, o sistema<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style="font-weight:bolder;">não executa a ação</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>e<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style="font-weight:bolder;">não exibe nenhuma mensagem de erro</strong>, impossibilitando o entendimento do problema pelo usuário.<br><strong style="font-weight:bolder;">Evidência:</strong><br>Vídeos demonstrando o comportamento:<br><a target=_blank href="https://drive.google.com/open?id=1R8F52dbfGegdS3-6VyGFGc9YQXJsqcpZ&amp;usp=drive_fs" style="text-decoration:underline;">https://drive.google.com/open?id=1R8F52dbfGegdS3-6VyGFGc9YQXJsqcpZ&amp;usp=drive_fs</a><br><br>***********************************************************