SSONA----</span><br style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;display:inline !important;">﻿Olá,</span><div style="margin:0px;display:block;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><br> </div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;">Precisamos alterar a página<span>&nbsp;</span><span></span><a target=_blank href="https://saude.sesisc.org.br/solucoes/seif/" rel="noopener nofollow noreferrer" style="text-decoration:underline;">https://saude.sesisc.org.br/solucoes/seif/<span></span></a><span>&nbsp;</span>para o que está sugerido em:<span>&nbsp;</span><span></span><a target=_blank href="https://www.figma.com/design/ZbfILvq8NdvRPRIjWnrZqm/SEIF?node-id=0-1&amp;p=f" rel="noopener nofollow noreferrer" style="text-decoration:underline;">https://www.figma.com/design/ZbfILvq8NdvRPRIjWnrZqm/SEIF?node-id=0-1&amp;p=f<span></span></a><br><br>Qualquer dúvida, como ponto de contato, podem acionar o<span>&nbsp;</span><span></span><span style="color:rgb(33, 150, 243);"><u style="text-decoration:underline;">andre.goulart@fiesc.com.br<span></span></u></span>&nbsp; </div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><br> </div><div style="margin:0px;display:block;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;">Obrigado! </div><br> </div>', null, null, 'pending', 'low', 'improvement', 'azure_devops', '27809', 'Tribo SEIF\Sustentação\Chamada Tecnológica', 'Tribo SEIF', null, null, 'Improvement', null, null, 32, 2, '2026-03-05 22:46:20.224', '2026-03-05 22:46:20.224', null, null),
