        (935, '[SS]Análise de Duplicidade de Questionários – SEIF Gestão de Terceiros', '<div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>*****************************************************************************************************************************************</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Prezados,</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Vinculado a solicitação interna realizada pela Dayana&nbsp;<b>ABERTO DIA 17/11/2025</b></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><br> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>1) Oque ocorre?<br><br><p>A colaboradora <strong>Dayana</strong>, vinculada à empresa <strong>VILLA FARNESE INCORPORAÇÕES LTDA (CNPJ 13.988.816/0001-17)</strong>, solicita uma análise referente a dois questionários que estão constando como <strong>duplicados</strong> no estabelecimento <strong>“RECANTO DO LAGO (TORRE 4 e 5) – nat.”</strong>. Os questionários são: </p><ul><li><p><strong>QUESTIONÁRIO OBRA MAIS SEGURA – V09.24</strong> </p> </li><li><p><strong>QUESTIONÁRIO OBRA MAIS SEGURA – V10.24 (Última Versão)</strong> </p> </li> </ul><p>A demanda consiste em: </p><ol><li><p>Identificar o motivo das duplicidades apresentadas. </p> </li><li><p>Verificar <strong>qual usuário inativou</strong> o questionário <strong>QUESTIONÁRIO OBRA MAIS SEGURA – V09.24</strong>. </p> </li> </ol><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>2 Quando começou a Ocorrer? N/A Atualmente</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>3) Ocorre pontualmente ou coletivamente? Coletivamente</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><br> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><div><br> </div><div><br> </div><div>4) Anexos exibem o ocorrido.<br><img src="https://dev.azure.com/senaisc-solucoes-digitais/c8f81c43-58a6-4ce1-96ce-4771ae6a012d/_apis/wit/attachments/8bd75136-4ad4-4e84-8c62-66cc9ac172d2?fileName=image.png" alt=Image><br><img src="https://dev.azure.com/senaisc-solucoes-digitais/c8f81c43-58a6-4ce1-96ce-4771ae6a012d/_apis/wit/attachments/422ac799-251e-42b1-9698-9c843c4f6de5?fileName=image.png" alt=Image><br><img src="https://dev.azure.com/senaisc-solucoes-digitais/c8f81c43-58a6-4ce1-96ce-4771ae6a012d/_apis/wit/attachments/66238275-68ca-4ec5-b9c9-0a74f27fdd9f?fileName=image.png" alt=Image><br> </div><div><br> </div> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>*****************************************************************************************************************************************</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Favor verificar.</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Att,</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Wesley Macedo Pinto</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>SENAI/SC - Soluções Digitais&nbsp;</font><span style="color:rgb(33, 33, 33);font-size:11pt;">&nbsp;</span><a target=_blank href="https://www.instagram.com/senaisolucoesdigitais.sc/" style="color:rgb(17, 85, 204);font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;;font-size:17.3333px;"><img src="https://c