        (1009, 'Cadastro de Empresas, Estabelecimentos e Checklists via API (Solicitante: Lucas Bergman)', '<div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>*****************************************************************************************************************************************</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Prezados,</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Vinculado a solicitação realizada pelo Lucas Bergman</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><br> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>1) Oque ocorre?</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><p><strong>Solicitante:</strong> Lucas Bergman </p><p>O solicitante encaminhou, via e-mail, uma requisição para <strong>cadastro via API (Postman)</strong> envolvendo <strong>Empresas</strong>, <strong>Estabelecimentos</strong> e <strong>Checklists</strong>. </p><hr><h3><strong>Empresas a serem cadastradas</strong> </h3><div><div tabindex=-1><table><thead><tr><th>CNPJ</th><th>Razão Social</th><th>Nome Fantasia</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>54.698.056/0001-00 </td><td>Residencial AP2 SPE LTDA </td><td>Residencial AP2 SPE LTDA </td></tr><tr><td>51.473.701/0001-89 </td><td>Residencial AP SPE LTDA </td><td>Residencial AP SPE LTDA </td></tr><tr><td>08.980.541/0001-35 </td><td>Giassi Construtora e Incorporadora Ltda </td><td>Giassi Construtora e Incorporadora Ltda </td></tr><tr><td>44.968.817/0001-23 </td><td>Construttore Zaya Incorporadora LTDA </td><td>Construttore Zaya Incorporadora LTDA </td></tr><tr><td>50.271.616/0001-75 </td><td>Construttore Maria Bay Incorporadora </td><td>Construttore Maria Bay Incorporadora </td></tr><tr><td>03.908.610/0001-86 </td><td>S