        (1035, 'Correção de Vinculação de Obra CNO 900239523672 via Banco de Dados', '<div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>*****************************************************************************************************************************************</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Prezados,</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Vinculado a solicitação realiza pelo Lucas Bergman mediante a cadastro via API</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><br> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>1) Oque ocorre?</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><p>Foi identificado um erro operacional no cadastro da obra <strong>IDA ROZZA</strong>, portadora do <strong>CNO 900239523672</strong>. A obra foi registrada <strong>incorretamente</strong> para a empresa <strong>GIASSI Construtora e Incorporadora Ltda (CNPJ 08.980.541/0001-35)</strong> por meio de integração via <strong>API</strong>. </p><p>O correto seria que o cadastro desta obra fosse realizado diretamente para a empresa <strong>Silva Packer Construtora e Incorporadora (CNPJ 03.908.610/0001-86)</strong>. </p><p>O registro ocorreu no dia <strong>13/12/2025</strong>, por meio de uma requisição enviada pelo <strong>Lucas Bergman</strong>, porém, devido a um <strong>erro operacional</strong>, a obra acabou sendo vinculada à empresa incorreta. </p><p>Dessa forma, <strong>solicitamos a migração da obra/estabelecimento via banco de dados</strong> para que ela seja devidamente realocada para a empresa <strong>Silva Packer Construtora e Incorporadora (CNPJ 03.908.610/0001-86)</strong>.<br><br>A obra não detém uso, assim sem dados, porem tem Checklists vinculados o qual também devem ser migrados com o estabelecimento. </p><span style="color:rgb(33, 43, 54);font-family:Montserrat, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;display:inline !important;"><span><span><span style="font-family:Montserrat, sans-serif;display:inline !important;"></span><br></span><span></span></span></span></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><br> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><div><br> </div><div>2) Anexos exibem o ocorrido. </div><div><img src="https://dev.azure.com/senaisc-solucoes-digitais/c8f81c43-58a6-4ce1-96ce-4771ae6a012d/_apis/wit/attachments/8c05fab6-e3dc-4759-b851-1a4b2e5bcfe2?fileName=image.png" alt=Image><br> </div> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>*****************************************************************************************************************************************</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Favor verificar.</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Att,</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Wesley Macedo Pinto</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>SENAI/SC - Soluções Digitais&nbsp;</font><span style="color:rgb(33, 33, 33);font-size:11pt;">&nbsp;</span><a target=_blank href="https://www.instagram.com/senaisolucoesdigitais.sc/" style="color:rgb(17, 85, 204);font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;;font-size:17.3333px;"><img src="https://ci3.googleusercontent.com/mail-sig/AIorK4wYQaC11fKLpqU5BR6NaVhZa9VkI0AxOacrnkINuwwY9jpdggMHbIQfOy8kAH2nu0qs0lNZ_8k" style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:small;color:rgb(32, 33, 36);"></a><span style="color:rgb(33, 33, 33);font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;;font-size:17.3333px;">&nbsp;</span><a target=_blank href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/senai-solu%C3%A7%C3%B5es-digitais/" style="color:rgb(17, 85, 204);font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;;font-size:17.3333px;"><img src="https://ci3.googleusercontent.com/mail-sig/AIorK4yoZ1R9g3fRoH8Zx9DJsz1IMoVdCGzfGBizZOUiANB8tz93hmoDucjkavskhK8ZXcCSiJz1bnk" style="font-family:Arial;font-size:11pt;"></a><span style="color:rgb(33, 33, 33);font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;;font-size:17.3333px;">&nbsp;</span><a target=_blank href="https://www.facebook.com/senaisolucoesdigitais.sc/" style="color:rgb(17, 85, 204);font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;;font-size:17.3333px;"><img src="https://ci3.googleusercontent.com/mail-sig/AIorK4xaI0BU0P03TbA_QM4W3_pkYh6xHU6xGVrzTdm8nQWhVuaejPeLebs67y01AtkmVUMzQjeKTrQ"></a> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Gerência Executiva de Negócios Digitais - GENED</font><br> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Serviço Nacional de Aprendizagem - SENAI</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Rua Marcolino Martins Cabral, 184 - Centro - 88701-000 - Tubarão – SC</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>www.sc.senai.br</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>*****************************************************************************************************************************************</font> </div><br> </div>', null, null, 'completed', 'low', 'task', 'azure_devops', '29117', 'Tribo SEIF\Sustentação\Chamada Tecnológica', 'Tribo SEIF', null, null, 'Ticket', null, null, 32, 2, '2