        (1050, 'Inconsistência no Link de Confirmação de Usuário – Ambiente de Treinamento', '<div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>*****************************************************************************************************************************************</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Prezados,</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Vinculado ao chamado do Zendesk:<span>&nbsp;</span><b>&lt;TICKET #2852&gt; ABERTO DIA 27/11/2025</b></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>1) Oque ocorre?</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><p>A solicitante <strong>Miria Luiza Xavier</strong> relata uma inconsistência ao confirmar o cadastro de um novo usuário no <strong>ambiente de treinamento</strong>, utilizando o endpoint:<br><strong><a rel=noopener href="https://tre.seif.com.br/home/for-suppliers/register">https://tre.seif.com.br/home/for-suppliers/register<span></span></a></strong> </p><p>Conforme informado, após realizar o cadastro no ambiente de treinamento do <strong>SEIF Gestão de Terceiros</strong>, o sistema envia automaticamente um e-mail para a usuária com o link de confirmação.<br>
No entanto, ao clicar no botão para confirmar o cadastro, ela é direcionada para um <strong>link quebrado</strong>, que, após análise, verificamos estar apontando incorretamente para o ambiente do <strong>SEIF Chamada Tecnológica</strong>. </p><p><strong>E-mail da usuária:</strong> <a rel=noopener>miria.luiza@fiemg.com.br</a> </p><span style="color:rgb(41, 50, 57);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Oxygen-Sans, Ubuntu, Cantarell, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;background-color:rgb(236, 249, 249);display:inline !important;"></span><br> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><br> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><div><br> </div><div><br> </div><div>2) Anexos exibem o ocorrido.<br><img src="https://dev.azure.com/senaisc-solucoes-digitais/c8f81c43-58a6-4ce1-96ce-4771ae6a012d/_apis/wit/attachments/fd394e62-05b0-4b96-a022-b554e3674f56?fileName=image.png" alt=Image><br> </div><div><br> </div> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>*****************************************************************************************************************************************</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Favor verificar.</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Att,</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Wesley Macedo Pinto</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>SENAI/SC - Soluções Digitais&nbsp;</font><span style="color:rgb(33, 33, 33);font-size:11pt;">&nbsp;</span><a target=_blank href="https://www.instagram.com/senaisolucoesdigitais.sc/" style="color:rgb(17, 85, 204);font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;;font-size:17.3333px;"><img src="https://ci3.googleusercontent.com/mail-sig/AIorK4wYQaC11fKLpqU5BR6NaVhZa9VkI0AxOacrnkINuwwY9jpdggMHbIQfOy8kAH2nu0qs0lNZ_8k" style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:small;color:rgb(32, 33, 36);"></a><span style="color:rgb(33, 33, 33);font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;;font-size:17.3333px;">&nbsp;</span><a target=_blank href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/senai-solu%C3%A7%C3%B5es-digitais/" style="color:rgb(17, 85, 204);font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;;font-size:17.3333px;"><img src="https://ci3.googleusercontent.com/mail-sig/AIorK4yoZ1R9g3fRoH8Zx9DJsz1IMoVdCGzfGBizZOUiANB8tz93hmoDucjkavskhK8ZXcCSiJz1bnk" style="font-family:Arial;font-size:11pt;"></a><span style="color:rgb(33, 33, 33);font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;;font-size:17.3333px;">&nbsp;</span><a target=_blank href="https://www.facebook.com/senaisolucoesdigitais.sc/" style="color:rgb(17, 85, 204);font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;;font-size:17.3333px;"><img src="https://ci3.googleusercontent.com/mail-sig/AIorK4xaI0BU0P03TbA_QM4W3_pkYh6xHU6xGVrzTdm8nQWhVuaejPeLebs67y01AtkmVUMzQjeKTrQ"></a> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Gerência Executiva de Negócios Digitais - GENED</font><br> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Serviço Nacional de Aprendizagem - SENAI</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Rua Marcolino Martins Cabral, 184 - Centro - 88701-000 - Tubarão – SC</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>www.sc.senai.br</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>***************************************************************************************************