        (1088, 'ZENDESK - Data de Emissão Retroagindo ao Salvar Documento – Documentos do Trabalhador', '<div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>*****************************************************************************************************************************************</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Prezados,</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Vinculado ao chamado do Zendesk:<span>&nbsp;</span><b>&lt;TICKET #2905&gt; ABERTO DIA 11/12/2025</b></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><br> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>1) Oque ocorre?</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><p>O colaborador <strong>Samuel Nascimento</strong> reporta um comportamento incorreto no módulo <strong>“Documentos do Trabalhador”</strong> do SEIF Gestão de Terceiros. </p><p>Ao realizar o upload de um documento e informar a <strong>data de emissão</strong>, o sistema está <strong>retroagindo a data em 1 dia</strong> após clicar em <em>“Salvar documento”</em>.<br>
Exemplo informado: ao registrar <strong>11/12/2025</strong>, o sistema salva automaticamente como <strong>10/12/2025</strong>. </p><p>Solicitamos análise da causa raiz, correção do tratamento da data e validação para garantir que a data informada pelo usuário seja gravada exatamente como ) <b>Anexos exibem o ocorrido.</b> </p></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><div><br> </div> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>*****************************************************************************************************************************************</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Favor verificar.</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Att,</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Wesley Macedo Pinto</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>SENAI/SC - Soluções Digitais&nbsp;</font><span style="color:rgb(33, 33, 33);font-size:11pt;">&nbsp;</span><a target=_blank href="https://www.instagram.com/senaisolucoesdigitais.sc/" style="color:rgb(17, 85, 204);font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;;font-size:17.3333px;"><img src="https://ci3.googleusercontent.com/mail-sig/AIorK4wYQaC11fKLpqU5BR6NaVhZa9VkI0AxOacrnkINuwwY9jpdggMHbIQfOy8kAH2nu0qs0lNZ_8k" style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:small;color:rgb(32, 33, 36);"></a><span style="color:rgb(33, 33, 33);font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;;font-size:17.3333px;">&nbsp;</span><a target=_blank href="https