        (1111, 'ZENDESK - Erro “Usuário inexistente ou senha inválida” no acesso ao ambiente TRE', '<div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>*****************************************************************************************************************************************</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Prezados,</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><br> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>1) Oque ocorre?<br><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><p><strong>Solicitante:</strong> Marlucia </p><p>A solicitante informa que <strong>não está conseguindo acessar o ambiente de treinamento</strong>, sendo apresentada a mensagem de erro:<br><strong>“Usuário inexistente ou senha inválida”.</strong> </p><p><strong>Usuário:</strong> <a rel=noopener>araujo@fiemg.com.br<span></span></a><br><strong>Ambiente:</strong> Treinamento (TRE)<br><strong>Link de acesso:</strong> <a rel=noopener href="https://tre.seif.com.br/login">https://tre.seif.com.br/login<span></span></a> </p><p><br> </p></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><div><br> </div><div>2) Anexos exibem o ocorrido. </div><div><img src="https://dev.azure.com/senaisc-solucoes-digitais/c8f81c43-58a6-4ce1-96ce-4771ae6a012d/_apis/wit/attachments/c06c5010-0c51-4330-9fbc-27ae6bc3a999?fileName=image.png" alt=Image><br> </div> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>*****************************************************************************************************************************************</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Favor verificar.</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size: