        (1186, 'SME 0123 Inclusão da Função “Exportar Dados” na Lista de Trabalhadores Mobilizados', '<div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL style="box-sizing:border-box;">*****************************************************************************************************************************************</font> </div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL style="box-sizing:border-box;">Prezados,<br style="box-sizing:border-box;"><br style="box-sizing:border-box;"></font> </div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL style="box-sizing:border-box;"><b style="box-sizing:border-box;">Solicitação realizada pelo colaborador</b>: Juliana via<span>&nbsp;</span><a href="https://senai-sd.slack.com/archives/G01P4ELDLD8/p1765459888441739" style="box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0, 90, 158);text-decoration:underline;cursor:pointer;">Slack</a><br style="box-sizing:border-box;"><br style="box-sizing:border-box;"><br style="box-sizing:border-box;"></font> </div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><br style="box-sizing:border-box;"> </div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><br style="box-sizing:border-box;"> </div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL style="box-sizing:border-box;">1) Oque ocorre?</font> </div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL style="box-sizing:border-box;"><br style="box-sizing:border-box;"></font> </div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL style="box-sizing:border-box;"><p style="box-sizing:border-box;"><strong style="box-sizing:border-box;">Descrição da melhoria:</strong><br style="box-sizing:border-box;">Incluir a funcionalidade<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style="box-sizing:border-box;">“Exportar Dados”</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>na tela/lista de<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style="box-sizing:border-box;">Trabalhadores Mobilizados</strong>, permitindo que os usuários exportem as informações exibidas para fins de análise e acompanhamento. </p><p style="box-sizing:border-box;">Solicitamos a gentileza de avaliar a viabilidade e priorização dessa implementação. </p><div style="box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:12px;"><img src="https://dev.azure.com/senaisc-solucoes-digitais/c8f81c43-58a6-4ce1-96ce-4771ae6a012d/_apis/wit/attachments/850ccb27-9ef9-41d2-bc81-5fd359410d06?fileName=image.png" alt=Image><br> </div></font> </div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL style="box-sizing:border-box;">*****************************************************************************************************************************************</font> </div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL style="box-sizing:border-box;"><br style="box-sizing:border-box;"></font> </div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL style="box-sizing:border-box;">Favor verificar.</font> </div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL style="box-sizing:border-box;"><br style="box-sizing:border-box;"></font> </div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL style="box-sizing:border-box;">Att,</font> </div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL style="box-sizing:border-box;"><br style="box-sizing:border-box;"></font> </div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL style="box-sizing:border-box;">Wesley Macedo Pinto</font> </div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL style="box-sizing:border-box;"><br style="box-sizing:border-box;"></font> </d