        (1319, 'Correção de CNPJ – Residencial AP2 SPE LTDA no SEIF', '<div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>*****************************************************************************************************************************************</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Prezados,</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><br> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>1) Oque ocorre?</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><p>A solicitante <strong>Dayana Santos</strong> informou que, durante o processo de abertura de oportunidades, foi identificado que o <strong>CNPJ inicialmente enviado pelo cliente estava incorreto</strong>. </p><p>O contrato já foi devidamente ajustado e assinado com o <strong>CNPJ correto</strong>, sendo necessária a <strong>correção desse dado também no sistema SEIF</strong>, para manter a consistência cadastral. </p><hr><h3><strong>Dados para Correção</strong> </h3><p><strong>ANTES</strong> </p><ul><li><p><strong>CNPJ:</strong> 54.698.056/0001-00 </p> </li><li><p><strong>Empresa:</strong> Residencial AP2 SPE LTDA </p> </li><li><p><strong>Estabelecimentos:</strong> </p><ul><li><p>Feel Beach And Park Torre 1 </p> </li><li><p>Feel Beach And Park Torre 2 </p> </li><li><p>Feel Beach And Park Torre 3 </p> </li> </ul> </li> </ul><p><strong>AGORA (correto)</strong> </p><ul><li><p><strong>CNPJ:</strong> 54.698.054/0001-00 </p> </li><li><p><strong>Empresa:</strong> Residencial AP2 SPE LTDA </p> </li><li><p><strong>Estabelecimentos:</strong> </p><ul><li><p>Feel Beach And Park Torre 1 </p> </li><li><p>Feel Beach And Park Torre 2 </p> </li><li><p>Feel Beach And Park Torre 3 </p> </li> </ul> </li> </ul><hr><h3><strong>Atividade Solicitada</strong> </h3><ul><li><p>Atualizar o <strong>CNPJ da empresa</strong> no SEIF Chamada Tecnológica. </p> </li><li><p>Garantir que a correção reflita corretamente nos <strong>estabelecimentos vinculados</strong>. </p> </li><li><p>Validar se não há impactos em contratos, obras, vínculos ou históricos relacionados. </p> </li> </ul><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><img src="https://dev.azure.com/senaisc-solucoes-digitais/c8f81c43-58a6-4ce1-96ce-4771ae6a012d/_apis/wit/attachments/3e086b7c-c414-46d0-9026-574ae4c56aab?fileName=image.png" alt=Image><br> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>*****************************************************************************************************************************************</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Favor verificar.</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Att,</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Wesley Macedo Pinto</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>SENAI/SC - Soluções Digitais&nbsp;</font><span style="color:rgb(33, 33, 33);font-size:11pt;">&nbsp;</span><a target=_blank href="https://www.instagram.com/senaisolucoesdigitais.sc/" style="color:rgb(17, 85, 204);font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;;font-size:17.3333px;"><img src="h