        (1350, 'IC – Usuário DR não consegue editar Manual no Gestão de Terceiros', '<div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL></font> </div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-family:ARIAL;"><font face=ARIAL style="box-sizing:border-box;">*****************************************************************************************************************************************</font> </div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-family:ARIAL;"><font face=ARIAL style="box-sizing:border-box;">Prezados,</font> </div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-family:ARIAL;"><font face=ARIAL style="box-sizing:border-box;"><br style="box-sizing:border-box;"></font> </div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-family:ARIAL;"><br style="box-sizing:border-box;"> </div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-family:ARIAL;"><font face=ARIAL style="box-sizing:border-box;">1) Oque ocorre?</font> </div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-family:ARIAL;"><font face=ARIAL style="box-sizing:border-box;"><br style="box-sizing:border-box;"></font> </div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-family:ARIAL;"><font face=ARIAL style="box-sizing:border-box;"><h3 style="box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:600;">Abertura do chamado </h3><ul style="box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 0px 0px 40px;"><li style="box-sizing:border-box;"><p style="box-sizing:border-box;"><strong style="box-sizing:border-box;">Solicitação realizada por:</strong><span>&nbsp;</span><strong style="box-sizing:border-box;">Juliana</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>– Analista de Sistemas </p> </li><li style="box-sizing:border-box;"><p style="box-sizing:border-box;"><strong style="box-sizing:border-box;">Canal:</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>Slack </p> </li><li style="box-sizing:border-box;"><p style="box-sizing:border-box;"><strong style="box-sizing:border-box;">Tipo:</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>Incidente (IC) </p> </li> </ul><h3 style="box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:600;">Descrição do problema </h3><p style="box-sizing:border-box;">Usuários do tipo<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style="box-sizing:border-box;">DN</strong>, ao acessarem a funcionalidade de<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style="box-sizing:border-box;">edição do Manual</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>no sistema<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style="box-sizing:border-box;">Gestão de Terceiros</strong>, não conseguem realizar a edição corretamente. </p><p style="box-sizing:border-box;">Ao clicar no<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style="box-sizing:border-box;">ícone de edição (lápis)</strong>, o sistema está<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style="box-sizing:border-box;">redirecionando indevidamente para a tela de cadastro da empresa</strong>, ao invés de permitir a edição do Manual. </p><p style="box-sizing:border-box;">Além disso, foi informado que<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style="box-sizing:border-box;">o ícone do lápis não deveria aparecer nesse contexto</strong>, conforme regra de negócio esperada. </p><h3 style="box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:600;">Comportamento esperado </h3><ul style="box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 0px 0px 40px;"><li style="box-sizing:border-box;"><p style="box-sizing:border-box;">Usuário do tipo<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style="box-sizing:border-box;">DN&nbsp;</strong>deve conseguir<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style="box-sizing:border-box;">editar o Manual corretamente</strong>, quando permitido. </p> </li><li style="box-sizing:border-box;"><p style="box-sizing:border-box;">O<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style="box-sizing:border-box;">ícone do lápis</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>deve aparecer<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style="box-sizing:border-box;">somente quando aplicável</strong>, conforme regra de permissão. </p> </li><li style="box-sizing:border-box;"><p style="box-sizing:border-box;">Ao clicar no lápis, o sistema deve<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style="box-sizing:border-box;">direcionar para a tela correta de edição do Manual</strong>, e não para o cadastro da empresa. </p> </li> </ul><h3 style="box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:600;">Comportamento atual </h3><ul style="box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 0px 0px 40px;"><li style="box-sizing:border-box;"><p style="box-sizing:border-box;">❌ Ao clicar no lápis, o sistema redireciona para<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style="box-sizing:border-box;">cadastro da empresa</strong>; </p> </li><li style="box-sizing:border-box;"><p style="box-sizing:border-box;">❌ Ícone do lápis aparece<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style="box-sizing:border-box;">indevidamente</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>para esse perfil/contexto. </p> </li> </ul><h3 style="box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:600;">Sistema / Módulo </h3><ul style="box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 0px 0px 40px;"><li style="box-sizing:border-box;"><p style="box-sizing:border-box;"><strong style="box-sizing:border-box;">Sistema:</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>SEIF – Gestão de Terceiros </p> </li><li style="box-sizing:border-box;"><p style="box-sizing:border-box;"><strong style="box-sizing:border-box;">Perfil impactado:</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>Usuário<span>&nbsp;</span><strong style="box-sizing:border-box;">DR</strong> </p> </li> </ul><h3 style="box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:600;">Evidência </h3><ul style="box-sizing:border-box;padding:0px 0px 0px 40px;"><li style="box-sizing:border-box;"><p style="box-sizing:border-box;">Anexo:&nbsp;<img src="https://dev.azure.com/senaisc-solucoes-digitais/c8f81c43-58a6-4ce1-96ce-4771ae6a012d/_apis/wit/attachments/f33abbb8-4408-42fe-9db6-7e1486f7c6fe?fileName=image.png" alt=Image style="box-sizing:border-box;max-width:100%;align-self:center;"> </p> </li> </ul><br style="box-sizing:border-box;"></font> </div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-family:ARIAL;"><br style="box-sizing:border-box;"> </div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-family:ARIAL;"><div style="box-sizing:border-box;"> </div><span style="color:rgb(200, 38, 19);"><b>Usuário DR não pode editar Manual, somente usuário DN pode editar (complementando)</b></span><div style="box-sizing:border-box;"><br style="box-sizing:border-box;"> </div> </div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-family:ARIAL;"><font face=ARIAL style="box-sizing:border-box;">*****************************************************************************************************************************************</font> </div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-family:ARIAL;"><font face=ARIAL style="box-sizing:border-box;"><br style="box-sizing:border-box;"></font> </div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-family:ARIAL;"><font face=ARIAL style="box-sizing:border-box;">Favor verificar.</font> </div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-family:ARIAL;"><font face=ARIAL style="box-sizing:border-box;"><br style="box-sizing:border-box;"></font> </div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-family:ARIAL;"><font face=ARIAL style="box-sizing:border-box;">Att,</font> </div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-family:ARIAL;"><font face=ARIAL style="box-sizing:border-box;"><br style="box-sizing:border-box;"></font> </div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-family:ARIAL;"><font face=ARIAL style="box-sizing:border-box;">Wesley Macedo Pinto</font> </div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-family:ARIAL;"><font face=ARIAL style="box-sizing:border-box;"><br style="box-sizing:border-box;"></font> </div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-family:ARIAL;"><font face=ARIAL style="box-sizing:border-box;"><br style="box-sizing:border-box;"></font> </div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;font-family:ARIAL;"><font face=ARIAL style="box-sizing:border-box;">SENAI/SC - Soluções Digitais&nbsp;</font><span style="box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(33, 33, 33);font-size:11pt;">&nbsp;</span><a target=_blank href="https://www.instagram.com/senaisolucoesdigitais.sc/" style="box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(17, 85, 204);text-decoration:underline;cursor:pointer;font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;;font-size:17.3333px;"><img src="https://ci3.googleusercontent.com/mail-sig/AIorK4wYQaC11fKLpqU5BR6NaVhZa9VkI0AxOacrnkINuwwY