tro acima via banco de dados em produção</strong> </p><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><br> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><div><br> </div><div>4) Anexos exibem o ocorrido. </div><div><img src="https://dev.azure.com/senaisc-solucoes-digitais/c8f81c43-58a6-4ce1-96ce-4771ae6a012d/_apis/wit/attachments/7b89f959-7e48-47a6-936e-bf33e3a160e6?fileName=image.png" alt=Image><br> </div> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>*****************************************************************************************************************************************</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Favor verificar.</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Att,</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Wesley Macedo Pinto</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>SENAI/SC - Soluções Digitais&nbsp;</font><span style="color:rgb(33, 33, 33);font-size:11pt;">&nbsp;</span><a target=_blank href="https://www.instagram.com/senaisolucoesdigitais.sc/" style="color:rgb(17, 85, 204);font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;;font-size:17.3333px;"><img src="https://ci3.googleusercontent.com/mail-sig/AIorK4wYQaC11fKLpqU5BR6NaVhZa9VkI0AxOacrnkINuwwY9jpdggMHbIQfOy8kAH2nu0qs0lNZ_8k" style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:small;color:rgb(32, 33, 36);"></a><span style="color:rgb