        (1405, 'Modulo 4 - SME 4003 Gerenciar Cadastros dos Agentes causadores', '<div><span>SME:</span> </div><div><a href="https://cnicombr.sharepoint.com/:w:/r/sites/sussiexterno/Documentos%20Compartilhados/Ger%C3%AAncia%20de%20Solu%C3%A7%C3%B5es%20Integradas%20em%20Sa%C3%BAde%20e%20Seguran%C3%A7a/Gest%C3%A3o%20de%20Terceiros%20-%20Geral/SEIF%20-%20Fase%204/Requisitos%20e%20SME%27s/SMEs%20M%C3%B3dulos/4.%20Monitoramento%20de%20Riscos%20e%20Sa%C3%BAde/SME%204003%20Gerenciar%20os%20Agentes%20causadores/SME%204003%20Gerenciar%20os%20Agentes%20causadores.docx?d=wbf0342a3d01d4ce8b8c3b5c873d695f5&amp;csf=1&amp;web=1&amp;e=4eQrbH">https://cnicombr.sharepoint.com/:w:/r/sites/sussiexterno/Documentos%20Compartilhados/Ger%C3%AAncia%20de%20Solu%C3%A7%C3%B5es%20Integradas%20em%20Sa%C3%BAde%20e%20Seguran%C3%A7a/Gest%C3%A3o%20de%20Terceiros%20-%20Geral/SEIF%20-%20Fase%204/Requisitos%20e%20SME%27s/SMEs%20M%C3%B3dulos/4.%20Monitoramento%20de%20Riscos%20e%20Sa%C3%BAde/SME%204003%20Gerenciar%20os%20Agentes%20causadores/SME%204003%20Gerenciar%20os%20Agentes%20causadores.docx?d=wbf0342a3d01d4ce8b8c3b5c873d695f5&amp;csf=1&amp;web=1&amp;e=4eQrbH</a> </div><div><br> </div><div><br> </div><div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;">Documento de analise do modulo 4:&nbsp;<a href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/1aNW0_vUHk9dRzPt8cheKlBrV8TNbR0Ff/edit?usp=sharing&amp;ouid=105804718406938075532&amp;rtpof=true&amp;sd=true" style="box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(152, 198, 255);text-decoration:underline;cursor:pointer;">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1aNW0_vUHk9dRzPt8cheKlBrV8TNbR0Ff/edit?usp=sharing&amp;ouid=105804718406938075532&amp;rtpof=true&amp;sd=true</a> </div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;"><br style="box-sizing:border-box;"> </div><div style="box-sizing:border-box;">Protótipo no figma:&nbsp;<a href="https://www.figma.com/design/GTZGww9PJNaeIQRpb0bB1N/SEIF---Fase-3---M%C3%B3dulo-4.-Monitoramento-de-Riscos-e-Sa%C3%BAde?node-id=1-4&amp;p=f&amp;t=KzYTkJ97ZTzTe6oE-0" style="box-sizi