        (1463, 'Ajuste de nomenclatura e novo cadastro de estabelecimento – PROCAVE', '<div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>*****************************************************************************************************************************************</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Prezados,</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><br> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>1) Oque ocorre?<br><br><p><strong>Resumo do que se espera resolver:</strong><br>
Ajustar a nomenclatura de um estabelecimento existente e realizar o cadastro de um novo estabelecimento vinculado à empresa PROCAVE INVESTIMENTOS E INCORPORAÇÕES LTDA. </p><p><strong>Task:</strong> </p><p>Realizar as seguintes ações no sistema: </p><ul><li><p><strong>Empresa:</strong> PROCAVE INVESTIMENTOS E INCORPORAÇÕES LTDA </p> </li><li><p><strong>CNPJ:</strong> 79.244.158/0007-52 </p> </li> </ul><ol><li><p><strong>Alterar a nomenclatura do estabelecimento existente</strong> para refletir corretamente: </p><ul><li><p>Catarina Village Bloco B (Torres 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9) </p> </li> </ul> </li><li><p><strong>PARA NOMENCLATURA estabelecimento</strong> com a seguinte nomenclatura: </p><ul><li><p>Catarina Village Bloco B (Torres 7, 8, 9, 10, 11) </p> </li> </ul> </li> </ol><p>Executar os ajustes conforme solicitado e validar a conclusão da ação. </p></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><div><br> </div><div><br> </div><div>2) Anexos exibem o ocorrido. </div><div><img src="https://dev.azure.com/senaisc-solucoes-digitais/c8f81c43-58a6-4ce1-96ce-4771ae6a012d/_apis/wit/attachments/89c1cb40-ffb6-4cf1-9053-b54aa386145f?fileName=image.png" alt=Image><br> </div> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>*****************************************************************************************************************************************</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Favor verificar.</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Att,</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br></font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL>Wesley Macedo Pinto</font> </div><div style="font-family:ARIAL;font-size:12px;"><font face=ARIAL><br>